  "description": "A framework to execute Various Actions:\n            - Abstractions: contracts for service location, configuration validation and data mapping\n            - Exceptions: business rule exceptions\n            - ExtensionMethods: string, validation, collection, HTTP, configuration and other helpers\n            - HttpMessageHandlers: forward or remove request headers, and forward the inbound authorization\n            - IdentityManagers: Azure credentials\n            - ILWeavers: method execution time logging\n            - IOManagers: files and folders, reading a file from its last line, and sections in the Windows hosts file\n            - JsonManagers: JSON serializer options\n            - Middlewares: global exception handling, and removal of the MCP session ID response header\n            - ProcessExecutionManagers: run processes, PowerShell scripts, Docker and Azure CLI commands with timeouts and cancellation; check and stop processes and ports; keep an app to one running instance\n            - ResilientHttpClientManager: HTTP client with retry and circuit-breaker policies\n            - Transactions: snapshot isolation transaction scope\n            - TypesManagers: type discovery and reflection helpers\n            - UICapabilities: app mode toggles, key sequence detection, and refreshing a window's data only while it is visible",
